{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20953","headline":"王濬墓下作 · 李贺","name":"王濬墓下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人间无阿童，犹唱水中龙。\n白草侵烟死，秋梨遶地红。\n古书平黑石，袖劒断青铜。\n耕势鱼鳞起，坟科马鬣封。\n菊花垂湿露，棘径卧乾蓬。\n松柏愁香涩，南原几夜风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}